{"id":"eba759f9-f4c9-4a21-8dc9-ad34cac59092","slug":"antica-trattoria-rustica-mobile-optimized","fullDescription":"Optimize for mobile: Stack layout vertically for small screens, collapse navigation to hamburger menu with toggle functionality, optimize hero section for mobile viewport with stacked text and image, make images responsive with proper aspect ratios, ensure all touch-friendly buttons minimum 44px height, use readable font sizes (min 16px for body text), adjust spacing/padding for mobile screens, simplify vintage frame on mobile (remove rotation, reduce border), make footer contact info single column on mobile. Keep desktop layout intact, add mobile-first media queries.","prompt":"Optimize for mobile: Stack layout vertically for small screens, collapse navigation to hamburger menu with toggle functionality, optimize hero section for mobile viewport with stacked text and image, make images responsive with proper aspect ratios, ensure all touch-friendly buttons minimum 44px height, use readable font sizes (min 16px for body text), adjust spacing/padding for mobile screens, simplify vintage frame on mobile (remove rotation, reduce border), make footer contact info single column on mobile. Keep desktop layout intact, add mobile-first media queries.\n\nHere is a reference implementation:\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"it\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script><script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Crimson+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>@import url('https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=zodiak@400,700&f[]=switzer@400,500,600&display=swap');:root {--terracotta: #C05E43;--cream: #FDF9F3;--sage: #7B8F76;--ink: #3D352F;}body {font-family: 'Switzer', sans-serif;background-color: var(--cream);color: var(--ink);}.font-serif-vintage {font-family: 'Zodiak', serif;}.font-script {font-family: 'Dancing+Script', cursive;}.paper-texture {background-image: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/natural-paper.png');}.terracotta-fade {background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(192, 94, 67, 0.1), transparent);}.ornament-border {border: 8px double var(--terracotta);padding: 1.5rem;margin: 0.5rem;}@media (min-width: 768px) {.ornament-border {padding: 2rem;margin: 1rem;}}.warm-glow {box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(192, 94, 67, 0.1);}#mobile-menu-checkbox:checked ~ #mobile-menu {display: flex;}</style></head><body><div class=\"min-h-screen paper-texture flex flex-col\"><!-- Header --><header class=\"relative z-50 px-6 md:px-8 py-8 md:py-10 flex flex-col items-center border-b border-stone-200/60\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2 mb-6 md:mb-8 text-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"tabler:clover\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#7B8F76]\"></iconify-icon><h1 class=\"font-serif-vintage text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tighter uppercase\">Antica Trattoria</h1><p class=\"font-script text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#C05E43] -mt-1 md:-mt-2\">Dalla Terra alla Tavola</p></div><!-- Hamburger Toggle (Mobile Only) --><div class=\"md:hidden absolute top-8 right-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mobile-menu-checkbox\" class=\"hidden\"><label for=\"mobile-menu-checkbox\" class=\"cursor-pointer block h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:menu\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#3D352F]\"></iconify-icon></label><div id=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 z-[60] bg-[#FDF9F3] paper-texture flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 animate-in fade-in zoom-in duration-300\"><label for=\"mobile-menu-checkbox\" class=\"absolute top-8 right-6 cursor-pointer\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:x\" class=\"text-3xl text-[#3D352F]\"></iconify-icon></label><ul class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-8 font-medium text-lg tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\"><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"mobile-nav-menu\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43]\">Menu</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"mobile-nav-storia\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43]\">La Nostra Storia</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"mobile-nav-prenota\" class=\"text-[#C05E43] font-bold underline underline-offset-8\">Prenota</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"mobile-nav-vini\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43]\">Cantina</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"mobile-nav-contatti\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43]\">Contatti</a></li></ul></div></div><nav class=\"hidden md:block w-full max-w-4xl\"><ul class=\"flex justify-center items-center gap-12 font-medium text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\"><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"nav-menu\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43] transition-colors\">Menu del Giorno</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"nav-storia\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43] transition-colors\">La Nostra Storia</a></li><li class=\"px-8 py-2 border border-[#C05E43] rounded-full\"><a href=\"#\" id=\"nav-prenota\" class=\"text-[#C05E43] hover:bg-[#C05E43] hover:text-white transition-all\">Prenota un Tavolo</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"nav-vini\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43] transition-colors\">Cantina</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" id=\"nav-contatti\" class=\"hover:text-[#C05E43] transition-colors\">Contatti</a></li></ul></nav></header><!-- Hero Section --><main class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-12 md:py-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 md:gap-8 flex-1 items-center\"><!-- Left Content (Text) --><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-8 md:space-y-10 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-left-8 md:slide-in-from-left-12 duration-1000 order-2 md:order-1\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><span class=\"text-[#7B8F76] font-bold tracking-widest text-[10px] md:text-xs uppercase\">Sapori di una volta • Roma, Trastevere</span><h2 class=\"font-serif-vintage text-5xl md:text-7xl leading-[1.1] md:leading-[0.9] text-[#3D352F]\">Il profumo del pane fresco e il calore di casa.</h2><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#C05E43]\"></div></div><p class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 max-w-md\">Sotto le viti secolari del nostro cortile, serviamo piatti che raccontano la storia di tre generazioni. Solo ingredienti di stagione, vino della casa e la gioia di stare insieme.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 md:gap-8\"><a href=\"#\" id=\"btn-scopri\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto text-center bg-[#3D352F] text-[#FDF9F3] px-10 py-5 rounded-sm font-serif-vintage text-lg hover:bg-[#C05E43] transition-colors min-h-[44px]\">Leggi il Menù</a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 group cursor-pointer py-2\"><span class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-stone-300 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-white transition-all\"><iconify-icon icon=\"ph:play-fill\" class=\"text-stone-400 group-hover:text-[#C05E43]\"></iconify-icon></span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase\">Il Cortile Segreto</span></div></div><!-- Review Overlay (Hidden on small mobile if needed, but keeping for content) --><div class=\"pt-8 md:pt-12 flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"italic font-serif-vintage text-2xl text-[#7B8F76]\">“</div><p class=\"italic text-stone-500 max-w-xs text-sm md:text-base\">La miglior carbonara che io abbia mai mangiato. Sembra di essere a cena da mia nonna in campagna.</p></div></div><!-- Right Visuals (Image) --><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-7 relative flex items-center justify-center order-1 md:order-2\"><!-- Vintage Frame --><div class=\"relative z-10 w-full md:w-[85%] aspect-[4/5] bg-stone-100 ornament-border shadow-2xl md:rotate-2 md:hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-700 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559339352-11d035aa65de?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1000\" alt=\"Ristorante Rustico\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover sepia-[0.2]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#C05E43]/10 mix-blend-multiply\"></div></div><!-- Decorative Items (Floating) --><div class=\"absolute -top-6 md:-top-12 -right-4 md:-right-8 z-20 w-32 md:w-48 rotate-12\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540189549336-e6e99c3679fe?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=500\" class=\"rounded-full border-[8px] md:border-[12px] border-[#FDF9F3] shadow-xl\" alt=\"Piatto Pasta\"></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute -bottom-4 -left-12 z-0 w-64 opacity-20 grayscale\"><iconify-icon icon=\"tabler:leaf\" class=\"text-[12rem] text-[#7B8F76]\"></iconify-icon></div><div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -right-4 md:-right-20 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6 text-[#C05E43]\"><a href=\"#\" id=\"social-fb\"><iconify-icon icon=\"ri:facebook-fill\" class=\"text-2xl hover:scale-125 transition-transform cursor-pointer\"></iconify-icon></a><a href=\"#\" id=\"social-ig\"><iconify-icon icon=\"ri:instagram-line\" class=\"text-2xl hover:scale-125 transition-transform cursor-pointer\"></iconify-icon></a><a href=\"#\" id=\"social-trip\"><iconify-icon icon=\"ri:tripadvisor-fill\" class=\"text-2xl hover:scale-125 transition-transform cursor-pointer\"></iconify-icon></a></div></div></main><!-- Botanical Border Footer --><footer class=\"mt-auto py-10 md:py-8 border-t border-stone-200/60 bg-[#F5EFE6]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-10 md:gap-0\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 text-[#7B8F76] text-center md:text-left\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\">Prenotazioni</span><a href=\"tel:+39061234567\" id=\"footer-phone\" class=\"font-serif-vintage text-lg md:text-xl text-[#3D352F] hover:text-[#C05E43]\">+39 06 123 4567</a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\">Indirizzo</span><span class=\"font-serif-vintage text-lg md:text-xl text-[#3D352F]\">Vicolo del Piede, 15, Roma</span></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 md:gap-4\"><iconify-icon icon=\"la:utensils\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#C05E43] opacity-30\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"la:wine-glass\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#C05E43] opacity-30\"></iconify-icon><iconify-icon icon=\"la:cheese\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[#C05E43] opacity-30\"></iconify-icon></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-8 pb-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 opacity-60\">© 2024 Antica Trattoria. Tutti i diritti riservati.</div></footer></div></body></html>\n```","structured":null,"images":[]}